# {{app.name}}

{{app.tagline}}

Create a responsive {{app.name}} using {{backend.technology}} for backend and {{frontend.framework}} for frontend
Implement user authentication and authorization using {{auth.solution}} for secure access
Design a modern, user-friendly UI using {{ui.library}} for responsive design
Use {{state.management}} for state management to handle complex application states
Create a user profile system with home details, maintenance history, and preferences
Implement a service request tool that allows users to submit requests for various home maintenance services (e.g., plumbing, electrical work, HVAC) and upload photos for better assessment
Design a booking system that allows users to schedule appointments with local service providers based on availability, including emergency services
Create a searchable service provider directory categorized by type (e.g., electricians, plumbers, landscapers) with a review and rating system
Implement automated maintenance reminders for regular tasks (e.g., changing air filters, gutter cleaning) with customizable settings
Establish a community forum where users can share experiences, ask questions about home maintenance, and provide tips to one another
Create a resource library with articles, videos, and guides on common home maintenance tasks and best practices, with search functionality
Create personalized notifications for upcoming service appointments, new resource library articles, and maintenance task reminders based on user preferences
Design an interactive cost estimator tool that helps users estimate potential costs for various home repair services based on common pricing data
Allow users to create project plans for larger renovations or repairs by breaking down tasks, timelines, and budgets
Implement data analytics to personalize recommendations based on user behavior and preferences in home maintenance
Design a custom API for third-party developers to integrate with the platform (e.g., local hardware stores)
Create an event calendar highlighting local workshops or classes related to home improvement skills (e.g., plumbing basics, electrical safety)
Incorporate gamification elements such as badges for completing DIY projects or participating in community discussions
Implement a referral program that rewards users for inviting friends to join the platform or use its services
Design an FAQ section addressing common questions about home maintenance services, scheduling processes, and using the platform effectively
Create a blog featuring expert advice on home improvement trends, DIY tips, seasonal maintenance checklists, and success stories from users who have utilized the service
Implement GDPR compliance features such as cookie consent and data protection policies
Design an accessibility feature to ensure compliance with WCAG standards
Create a loyalty program for frequent users with tiered rewards and benefits
Implement push notifications in the mobile app for real-time updates about service appointments and reminders